{"siren:A team is considering a four-day working week. Supporters argue that fewer interruptions could improve concentration and reduce staff turnover. However, the support desk must remain available five days a week. A small trial elsewhere reported higher satisfaction, but did not measure response times. One manager proposes a staggered schedule for three months, with service quality reviewed every fortnight.":"7fbcd0fce4963d7234d590a400aad2e68c5916f01e62343b0841e1165f42a2a7"}